.SH "نام (NAME)"
darktable\-cmstest \- test if the color management subsystem of your computer is correctly configured
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 1
\&    darktable\-cmstest
.Ve
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBdarktable\fR is a digital photography workflow application for \fBLinux\fR, \fBMac OS X\fR and several other \fBUnices\fR.
It\*(Aqs described further in \fBdarktable\fR\|(1).
.PP
\&\fBdarktable\-cmstest\fR investigates if the color management subsystem of your computer is correctly configured and it displays some useful information about the installed monitor profile(s).
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBdarktable\fR\|(1)
